<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds start little changed, eye U.S. data.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds start little changed, eye U.S. data.</headline>
<text>
<p>0730 GMT - Spanish government bonds open mostly unchanged, seen drifting within narrow range before key U.S. data.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 108.80 vs 108.84, yield 6.11 vs 6.10</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 118.26 vs 118.29 at Wednesday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.41/43 vs 84.38/39</p>
